# did (ID, CLASS, START-DATE, END-DATE, DURATION, PLANNED-DURATION, END-ON-NEXT and every other
# attribute), and after each update of the variant playlist the demuxer posts an element message
# "hls-date-ranges" holding them, each anchored to stream time through the program date-time of
# the segment that covers its START-DATE.
#
# Applied by build_deps with patch -p1.

